From: EmberBSD (AI-assisted)
Subject: Keep libproxy generators on the build host and make optional data explicit

Use libproxy 0.5.12 from pinned pkgsrc; retain the original archive checksums.
All runtime proxy backends and GIR data remain enabled.

https://github.com/libproxy/libproxy/archive/refs/tags/0.5.12.tar.gz
SHA256: a1fa55991998b80a567450a9e84382421a7176a84446c95caaa8b72cf09fa86f

Apply this delta after the common graphics libproxy delta.
Keep the complete toolkit output and its GIR query path unchanged.

